Split-half (odd/even game) reliability of team-season H2-H1 change; Design 5 on triggered vs non-triggered units; early-vs-rest possession dip.\n- observed_verdict: inconclusive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_confidence: low (0.15)"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-015", "score": 0.104, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-015 | Study family SF-APPS-015: Player BEST/AVOID tier tendency in H2 trigger games (55 series)\n- observed_research_question: Player BEST/AVOID tier tendency in H2 trigger games (55 series)\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: Teams and players differ in how often H2 trigger possessions land on the engine's BEST vs AVOID counter.\n- observed_result: Team AVOID% ranges 50.6% (ORL) to 6.8% (SAC); team BEST% 0.0%-15.8%.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- observed_failure_evidence: No outcome test; player samples 10-178 possessions.\n- observed_sample_and_power: min 10 poss per player\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-048\n- observed_method: trigger_table_clean.csv, 55 series 2022-2026, 179 players, 25 teams, min 10 poss.\n- observed_verdict: descriptive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_confidence: medium (0.65)\n- auto_addresses_question: RQC:RQC-001"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-011", "score": 0.102, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-011 | Study family SF-APPS-011: Regular season vs playoff PPP by play type (DRIVE over-prediction)\n- observed_research_question: Regular season vs playoff PPP by play type (DRIVE over-prediction)\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: DRIVE PPP is materially higher in RS than playoffs, so an RS-calibrated optimizer over-recommends DRIVE.\n- observed_result: DRIVE RS 1.198 vs PO 0.912 (-0.286, 25 teams); PNR -0.173; PULL_UP +0.301; others within -0.07.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- observed_failure_evidence: DRIVE playoff PPP 0.286 below RS across 25 teams; top-10 teams all -0.30 to -0.43.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 25 teams, min 30 poss per cell; no CIs\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: Team-level (team, PT, context) cells, min 30 poss, up to 25 teams.\n- observed_verdict: supported\n- observed_failure_type: D_positive\n- observed_notes: Motivated the playoff DRIVE exclusion and a proposed playoff DSI offset."}], "n_results": 4}

